      ],
      "source": "https://delawareriverheritagetrail.org/2021/09/24/riverside-township/",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Taubel Hosiery Company once operated 33 factories across the eastern U.S., making Riverside a textile hub.",
